  "_implementation_notes": [
    "SILPH CO. LOWER FLOORS (Maps 121, 212, 660, 661, 662)",
    "",
    "Fill dialogue for the Silph Co. crisis \u2014 Team Rocket's",
    "occupation of floors 1F through 4F. Establishes the",
    "chaos of the takeover and the varied motivations of",
    "Rocket grunts (true believers, scared recruits, opportunists).",
    "",
    "Map 121: Lobby (post-liberation shop + NPC dialogue)",
    "Map 212: Connector (elevator floor selection)",
    "Map 660: 2F Finances (grunts + hostage employee)",
    "Map 661: 3F HR (grunts + turncoat scientist + hostage)",
    "Map 662: 4F Marketing (grunts + hiding employee)",
    "",
    "Switch 228 = Silph Co. liberated (Team Rocket defeated)",
    "Switch 1038 = specific Silph progress flag",
    "",
    "Line length limit: ~42 characters per line."
  ],
